# The production frontend image does not read these variables.
# mary-element/src/service/api.js sets baseURL to /api/v1, so the page and
# the API share one hostname. Leave this file as a record of that choice.
#
# VITE_API_URL=
# VITE_APP_NAME=Mary Care
#
# Use a separate API hostname only after both of these are true:
# 1. baseURL is changed to the API origin, for example
#    https://registryv2-api.stmarysteamcare.co.uk/api/v1
#    and the frontend image is rebuilt.
# 2. CORS_ORIGINS is the page origin
#    https://registryv2.stmarysteamcare.co.uk
#    and ALLOWED_HOSTS includes the API hostname.
# Until that change, deploy templates/nginx-single-origin.conf
# and do not deploy templates/nginx-split-api.conf.
